-------------
- Fastify by Matteo Collina, Tomas Della Vedova and contributors, with its static, view and websocket plugins. MIT. https://fastify.dev
- Nunjucks by James Long and Mozilla renders every page. BSD-2-Clause. https://mozilla.github.io/nunjucks
